      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اطّمر عَلَيْهِ</span></b> , of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِفْتَعَلَ</span>, [originally
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِطْتَمَرَ</span>,] <i>He leaped upon him,</i> namely, a horse,
(K,) and a camel, (TA,) <i>from behind,</i> (K, TA,)
<i>and mounted him.</i> (TA.)

